      "message": "The original file is marked oneway, but apparently the AIDL freezer puts it on each method instead. I guess the two are equivalent, so if in v2 we add a method that\u0027s not oneway, and mark all the others as oneway, then it will still be a compatible change and is easier to check this way ? Pure speculation.",
